file glow/tokens.rye max_decimal_lit_digits and max_aura_digits named, scan_digits taking its ceiling from the caller
file glow/tokens_witness.rye five legs -- ten digits welcome, eleven refused, 007 still one token, @u128 welcome, four aura digits refused
file tools/g/glow_tokens_witness.rish the five claims asserted from the runner
file active-designing/docs/glow/machine-reading.md the bounds table gains two rows and the page declares its setting
file session-logs/README.md 20260908 closed at 159, 20260909 opened
file session-logs/CHAPTERS.md three drifted counts repaired from the shelves
file construction/ITINERARY.md the Pheromone account, elder shelved whole
scope two finished laps of this seat recovered from a diverged branch and a stash and landed with their rows renumbered by the spine; one real red closed at the door; one bound seated on the language's last unbounded span
status GREEN -- glow_tokens_witness, glow_desk_run on 347 desks, glow_desk_reach, glow_decimal_law, reds_ledger_monotone, exec_bit, tame_style_check, width_check all green; log_has_a_row and stash_record both moved to ok; hot roster pass named below
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- three doors, all yours: does Glow refuse a leading zero everywhere or accept one everywhere; where does a live red go while the REDS pin is deadlocked; and why a finished, GREEN lap of this seat left the branch twice in one night, which no guard in the tree reads
